# Keep deploys lean. Do not omit workspace package.json roots (breaks bun.lock).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/out
apps/backend/server
apps/backend/dist
apps/backend/llms-full.txt
webmail
**/.wrangler
**/.vinext
**/*.p8
.env*
!.env.example
# Native app source is large; keep package.json for workspace resolution.
apps/native/**
!apps/native/package.json
apps/gatus/**
!apps/gatus/package.json
apps/stalwart/**
!apps/stalwart/package.json
apps/notifications/**
!apps/notifications/package.json
!apps/notifications/go.mod
